---------------

The Apache release artifact for Apache OpenServerless is the SOURCE
distribution, which is licensed in its entirety under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, reproduced above. The container image built from the
Dockerfile beside this file is a CONVENIENCE BINARY which additionally
bundles the third-party components recorded below, each under its own
license.

The ASF classification of these licenses follows
<https://www.apache.org/legal/resolved.html>. Components whose licenses
are not compatible with the Apache License 2.0, and components that
require special handling, are enumerated in the WARN file.

The complete texts of the licenses referenced below, other than those
reproduced in this file, are distributed with each component inside the
container image, in the package metadata directories of the respective
package manager:

  * Python packages: <site-packages>/<dist>.dist-info/ (LICENSE, METADATA)
  * Debian packages: /usr/share/doc/<pkg>/copyright

---------------

openserverless-operator contains ConcurrentMapBackedCache.scala in
`common/scala/src/main/scala/org/apache/openwhisk/core/database/`, which contains
an implementation derived from Spray Caching 1.3.4
<http://spray.io/documentation/1.2.4/spray-caching/>, namely from
`spray.caching.Cache` and `spray.caching.SimpleLruCache`. This code was
released under an Apache 2.0 license.
Copyright (C) 2011-2015 the spray project <http://spray.io>

---------------

openserverless-operator bundles the files gradlew and gradlew.bat from Gradle
v5.5, which were released under an Apache 2.0 license.
For details see ./gradlew and ./gradlew.bat.

---------------

The openserverless-operator container image bundles the following Python
runtime dependencies, resolved from pyproject.toml and poetry.lock, which
were released under an Apache 2.0 license.

  * aiosignal (1.4.0)
  * asttokens (3.0.0)
  * bcrypt (4.2.1)
  * frozenlist (1.5.0)
  * google-auth (2.37.0)
  * kubernetes (31.0.0)
  * minio (7.2.14)
  * multidict (6.1.0)
  * propcache (0.2.1)
  * pykube-ng (23.6.0)
  * requests (2.32.4)
  * rsa (4.9)
  * tzdata (2024.2)
  * websocket-client (1.8.0)
  * yarl (1.18.3)

aiohttp (3.14.3) was released under an Apache 2.0 AND MIT license.
python-dateutil (2.9.0.post0) was released under an Apache 2.0 OR
BSD-3-Clause license.

